# Biometrics where there are none to ask (device-layer-0021): the abstract module beside the env dirs, reached by every
# env with none of its own (a browser, a desktop JVM, Rust, node, the memory host). Conforms to ../biometric.

task read-biometric-kind
  like text
  send back, text <unavailable>

task ask-biometric
  take reason, like text
  like text
  send back, text <unavailable>
